cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Janus, please cite it as below."
title: "Janus: An Anticipatory Memory Benchmark"
abstract: "A benchmark for both faces of LLM memory — recall (find the right past fact) and anticipatory prefetch (predict and warm the next-needed context) — on self-generated data with an exact Bayes ceiling and judge-free recall grading."
